# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The Pixel 8a's camera in Camera.app (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.akitacam2, with camera=13): what AVFoundation lists, then the
# application opened from the home screen as a finger opens it (first page, top right) and its preview left running for a
# (akitacam3, 11-18: Camera.app opened BY ITS IDENTIFIER -- a tap on its icon missed whenever the home screen was on another
# page --, a photograph with the back camera, the cameras exchanged, a photograph with the front one)
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 8 notify com.hakios.unlock wait 2 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 4
/redwood/bin/lsreg -o com.apple.camera
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 14 tap 0.5 0.877 wait 9 tap 0.878 0.877 wait 10 tap 0.5 0.877 wait 30
